sequenceDiagram
    participant Flush as Memtable Flush
    participant SST as SSTables
    participant STCS as STCS Strategy
    participant Comp as Compactor
    participant New as New SSTable
    
    Note over Flush,SST: Initial State: 0 SSTables
    
    Flush->>SST: Flush creates SSTable-1 (100MB)
    Note over SST: 1 SSTable (Tier 0)
    
    Flush->>SST: Flush creates SSTable-2 (100MB)
    Note over SST: 2 SSTables (Tier 0)
    
    Flush->>SST: Flush creates SSTable-3 (100MB)
    Note over SST: 3 SSTables (Tier 0)
    
    Flush->>SST: Flush creates SSTable-4 (100MB)
    Note over SST: 4 SSTables (Tier 0)
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over STCS: Trigger: min_threshold (4) reached
        STCS->>STCS: Identify similar-sized SSTables
        STCS->>Comp: Compact SST-1,2,3,4
        
        par Continue accepting writes
            Flush->>SST: Flush creates SSTable-5
        and Compaction in background
            Comp->>Comp: Merge 4 SSTables
            Note over Comp: Read all 4 (400MB)<br/>Merge and deduplicate<br/>Write amplification: ~4×
            Comp->>New: Create SSTable-A (350MB)
            Note over New: Tier 1: Larger SSTable
        end
        
        Comp->>SST: Delete SST-1,2,3,4
        Comp->>SST: Add SSTable-A
    end
    
    Note over SST: State: SST-5 (Tier 0) + SST-A (Tier 1)
    
    Flush->>SST: More flushes... SST-6,7,8
    Note over SST: 4 SSTables in Tier 0 again
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over STCS: Second compaction
        STCS->>Comp: Compact SST-5,6,7,8
        Comp->>New: Create SSTable-B (350MB)
    end
    
    Note over SST: State: SST-A (Tier 1) + SST-B (Tier 1)
    
    Note over SST: Eventually: 4 Tier-1 SSTables
    
    rect rgb(255, 240, 200)
        Note over STCS: Major compaction<br/>Tier 1 → Tier 2
        STCS->>Comp: Compact 4 × 350MB SSTables
        Note over Comp: Read 1.4GB<br/>Write amplification: ~16×
        Comp->>New: Create SSTable-X (1.2GB)
        Note over New: Tier 2: Very large SSTable
    end
    
    Note over SST,New: STCS Characteristics:<br/>✓ Low write amplification initially<br/>✓ Good for write-heavy workloads<br/>✗ High space amplification (up to 50%)<br/>✗ High read amplification (many SSTables)
    
    style SST fill:#e1f5ff
    style New fill:#e1ffe1
    style Comp fill:#fff4e1